1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,860
I'm pleased to report that tickets are selling rapidly, and we should sell the remaining 450 tickets by the end of the week.

2
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:11,240
It appears as though everyone in town is eager to hear Jennifer Evans sing.

3
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:14,700
Just so you know, the posters haven't arrived yet.

4
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:20,560
Eric happened to notice a mistake as the number 23 was written on the posters instead of 13.

5
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:25,900
So the printer had to make a change and threw away the posters which had already been printed.

6
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:33,195
I've been informed that the posters will arrive tomorrow, so we'll send a few of you out to post them in places around town then.
